# A copy's mana cost is copied with X as 0 (CR 107.3m, 707.2; the card's ruling), and counters are not copied. Bot1's
# Walking Ballista is cast for X = 2 and enters with two +1/+1 counters. Clone copies it: it is a Walking Ballista whose
# "enters with X +1/+1 counters" sees no X spent on it, so it enters with none, a 0/0 that is put into the graveyard
# (CR 704.5f). The original keeps its two counters.

